  "body": "### Description\r\n\r\nThe [Grafana dashboard](https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/blob/master/contrib/grafana/synapse.json) contains a mishmash of at least three different datasource UIDs for the Prometheus datasource type, leading to errors or \"missing data\" because only one of them is actually defined as a variable.\r\n\r\nFor example:\r\n- `\"uid\": \"000000001\"`\r\n- `\"uid\": \"${DS_PROMETHEUS}\"`\r\n- `\"uid\": \"$datasource\"`",
